  "title": "Orchard Harvest",
  "statement": "A picker walks through an orchard grid from the top-left tree to the bottom-right tree, moving only right or down, and collects all the fruit on each tree it passes (including both ends). Return the most fruit it can collect.",
  "examples": [
    {
